WEBVTT

00:19.695 --> 00:24.033
The wound inside
my sealed memories

00:24.033 --> 00:28.737
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.737 --> 00:36.378
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.378 --> 00:41.250
I seek boundless strength

00:41.250 --> 00:52.027
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.027 --> 00:54.096
I want to protect

00:54.096 --> 00:56.398
I want to believe

00:56.398 --> 01:00.669
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.669 --> 01:05.074
The heat and the love

01:05.074 --> 01:09.278
I accept them all

01:09.278 --> 01:12.948
I won't let go of your hand again

01:12.948 --> 01:21.287
Aiming towards that light...

01:30.432 --> 01:34.266
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:37.806 --> 01:40.542
It's our responsibility
to take care of...

01:40.542 --> 01:42.567
the Princess from
today onwards.

01:43.178 --> 01:46.782
It's a shame, but a curse
was cast on her...

01:46.782 --> 01:49.051
and it can never
be removed.

01:49.051 --> 01:51.453
The situation now
is such that...

01:51.453 --> 01:54.047
an onmyouji must always
be by her side.

01:55.291 --> 01:57.282
I'm counting on you.

01:59.161 --> 02:02.358
The Evil Song Brought by
the Whirlwind

02:13.676 --> 02:16.941
I call to the soul that
lingers in the darkness...

02:24.453 --> 02:27.786
Awaken and cross
the barrier of time.

02:34.430 --> 02:37.297
By the song that pierces
the earth...

02:42.304 --> 02:44.966
Dark chains will
seize you.

02:50.145 --> 02:52.114
Do you feel hatred?

02:52.114 --> 02:55.684
Yes, I do!
I feel hatred!

02:55.684 --> 02:58.354
Yes, hatred.

02:58.354 --> 03:02.313
You were left to die alone
in this desolate place.

03:03.192 --> 03:04.593
But...

03:04.593 --> 03:07.563
the man who caused you
to be in this state...

03:07.563 --> 03:10.132
lives an extravagant
life over there.

03:10.132 --> 03:13.302
I hate him... I resent him...

03:13.302 --> 03:15.395
That loathsome man...

03:29.685 --> 03:32.221
No... a while more...

03:32.221 --> 03:34.857
Come on, Masahiro!
If you don't wake up now,

03:34.857 --> 03:37.291
you won't get to the
onmyou dorms on time!

03:43.832 --> 03:46.392
Wh-What... what's wrong?

03:46.802 --> 03:48.565
Good morning!

03:51.140 --> 03:54.443
- M-Mother!
- Good morning, dear.

03:54.443 --> 03:59.048
W-Why did you send
Akiko to wake me up?

03:59.048 --> 04:01.383
I was busy preparing
breakfast,

04:01.383 --> 04:03.986
so I asked Miss Akiko
if she could do it.

04:03.986 --> 04:06.455
But... well...

04:06.455 --> 04:09.324
But asking Akiko to
help out here is...

04:09.324 --> 04:13.062
- Well... Is that all right?
- Why not?

04:13.062 --> 04:15.964
Why not? Akiko is...

04:15.964 --> 04:19.923
a princess after all and
we're taking care of her.

04:21.603 --> 04:24.506
Don't be so reserved.

04:24.506 --> 04:26.975
She's a member of
our family now.

04:26.975 --> 04:29.344
That was what
I was told.

04:29.344 --> 04:31.869
Didn't you tell me
that, Father?

04:33.082 --> 04:35.818
Well, I know that... But...

04:35.818 --> 04:40.756
That's right. Your family's
really kind to take me in...

04:40.756 --> 04:44.793
So I should help out with some of
the chores. Right, Lady Tsuyuki?

04:44.793 --> 04:49.231
Yes. I take it as my duty to
show you our way of life...

04:49.231 --> 04:52.367
so you can fit into
our little family.

04:52.367 --> 04:54.503
- Sure!
- Now...

04:54.503 --> 04:57.206
Shall we bring Masahiro
his breakfast?

04:57.206 --> 04:59.575
Yes, Lady Tsuyuki.

04:59.575 --> 05:02.244
A high ranking princess
does not need...

05:02.244 --> 05:04.439
to learn these things
though...

05:04.880 --> 05:07.416
Oh, but I'd be really
bored then.

05:07.416 --> 05:09.247
That's true.

05:15.257 --> 05:18.317
You seem to be
taking things easy.

05:18.527 --> 05:21.864
Your father left the house
a long time ago...

05:21.864 --> 05:24.958
But you're still dressed
in that manner.

05:41.517 --> 05:44.953
All right! I'm going to make
up for all the lost time!

05:45.254 --> 05:46.822
Good luck then!

05:46.822 --> 05:49.391
I'll copy all the calendars
by today!

05:49.391 --> 05:51.951
Well, if it isn't Masahiro.

05:52.294 --> 05:54.524
So you actually came today?

05:55.464 --> 05:57.125
Toshitsugu.

05:58.233 --> 06:00.536
Fujiwara no Toshitsugu?

06:00.536 --> 06:02.571
I heard you were unwell
a while ago.

06:02.571 --> 06:05.374
- You're all right now?
- Yes.

06:05.374 --> 06:08.443
Everyone was talking about
Masahiro's poor health,

06:08.443 --> 06:10.775
so we were worried about you.

06:12.214 --> 06:14.917
Don't worry, I'm fine.

06:14.917 --> 06:18.453
You should try not
to be sick so often.

06:18.453 --> 06:22.891
Maybe his poor hygiene
is affecting his health.

06:22.891 --> 06:27.396
You mustn't make your father or
grandfather worry about you.

06:27.396 --> 06:31.298
Y-You're right...
I'll bear that in mind.

06:31.667 --> 06:33.635
It must be really tough...

06:33.635 --> 06:37.206
Being the grandson of the
famous Abe no Seimei.

06:37.206 --> 06:39.041
No, it's not.

06:39.041 --> 06:43.745
I hear your two older brothers
are very talented as well.

06:43.745 --> 06:46.949
It must be stressful being
the only one with no talent.

06:46.949 --> 06:50.441
But work harder and
keep your spirits up.

06:53.789 --> 06:55.381
Mokkun?

06:57.726 --> 07:00.286
You phony onmyouji!

07:04.299 --> 07:06.501
W-What happened,
Toshitsugu?

07:06.501 --> 07:09.902
W-Well... suddenly
my head went...

07:14.109 --> 07:17.512
So what if he's one of
the best onmyou trainees!

07:17.512 --> 07:19.912
He doesn't even have
much power!

07:20.582 --> 07:22.985
The mere thought of him
makes me angry!

07:22.985 --> 07:26.288
Now, now... Don't be angry.

07:26.288 --> 07:29.691
That guy was picking on you!
And you're not mad?!

07:29.691 --> 07:32.888
Well, you're angry on
my behalf, aren't you?

07:33.095 --> 07:35.586
- Geez...
- Masahiro?

07:36.265 --> 07:38.467
- Akiko...
- Here.

07:38.467 --> 07:40.765
It's your new robe.

07:43.005 --> 07:45.474
- Where should I put it?
- I'll take it!

07:45.474 --> 07:47.840
- I'll do it myself!
- But...

07:49.311 --> 07:53.048
You're a Fujiwara princess. You
shouldn't be doing such things!

07:53.048 --> 07:56.485
Well... I'm part of the
Abe family now, right?

07:56.485 --> 07:59.521
That's true, but...

07:59.521 --> 08:02.547
Is my presence here
a bother to you?

08:03.025 --> 08:05.016
No, it's not that!

08:06.295 --> 08:09.162
Hey, were you getting
ready to go out?

08:09.598 --> 08:13.035
Well... I guess so.

08:13.035 --> 08:14.703
But it's already so late.

08:14.703 --> 08:17.372
Masahiro has many things
to deal with right now.

08:17.372 --> 08:19.374
He's at the onmyou
dorms in the day...

08:19.374 --> 08:23.078
And he seeks evil ayakashi
in the capital at night.

08:23.078 --> 08:25.947
You mean you battle
evil spirits?

08:25.947 --> 08:27.482
Isn't that dangerous?

08:27.482 --> 08:30.986
Don't worry. There are not
too many bad demons.

08:30.986 --> 08:32.788
I see...

08:32.788 --> 08:34.589
Don't let my mother know.

08:34.589 --> 08:37.888
Though I think my father and
grandfather are aware of it.

08:42.497 --> 08:45.000
- Be careful.
- I will.

08:45.000 --> 08:47.662
You'd better go inside.
It's cold out here.

08:48.503 --> 08:52.240
I'll be fine. You should
take care too.

08:52.240 --> 08:54.037
Come back soon.

09:05.587 --> 09:08.920
Hey, Seimei's grandson!

09:14.129 --> 09:15.630
Don't say grandson!

09:15.630 --> 09:18.867
Hey, hey, I think there's
something weird moving around.

09:18.867 --> 09:21.770
- Something weird?
- It's an onryou.

09:21.770 --> 09:25.073
- What?
- It's a scary one too!

09:25.073 --> 09:26.842
An onryou, in case
you didn't know,

09:26.842 --> 09:28.877
is the vengeful spirit
of a dead person...

09:28.877 --> 09:31.847
who didn't rest in peace and
later gained monstrous powers.

09:31.847 --> 09:33.382
I know that!

09:33.382 --> 09:36.918
It was spotted wandering
through the back streets.

09:36.918 --> 09:39.087
Do you know where
it is now?

09:39.087 --> 09:42.357
Nobody knows.
It just simply vanished.

09:42.357 --> 09:44.382
An onryou...

09:49.364 --> 09:51.700
What are you doing
here, Rikugou?

09:51.700 --> 09:53.395
Something's coming.

09:58.707 --> 10:00.436
What's that?

10:02.043 --> 10:04.603
The aura around it
is ominous.

10:11.586 --> 10:14.612
[chant]

10:17.392 --> 10:19.194
- A snake!
- No way...

10:19.194 --> 10:22.063
- That can't be the onryou!
- No, no!

10:22.063 --> 10:23.865
The one we saw
wasn't like that!

10:23.865 --> 10:26.333
We've never seen
anything like this before!

10:27.869 --> 10:30.303
[chant]

10:34.976 --> 10:38.343
[chant]

10:46.087 --> 10:47.923
Soldiers that confront,
men that fight,

10:47.923 --> 10:50.483
fall into place and
go forth with might!

11:00.635 --> 11:02.971
- Thank you, Rikugou.
- Something's not right.

11:02.971 --> 11:04.905
That ended too easily.

11:05.540 --> 11:09.778
It was different from the other
demons that we encountered.

11:09.778 --> 11:11.370
Masahiro!

11:11.780 --> 11:14.416
You seem to have made
some improvement.

11:14.416 --> 11:15.817
Grandfather.

11:15.817 --> 11:18.547
Well, if you keep up
the training...

11:19.287 --> 11:22.224
I'm sure you'll become
a great onmyouji soon.

11:22.224 --> 11:25.760
Don't do that!
I'm not a kid anymore.

11:25.760 --> 11:28.163
What are you doing
here anyway?

11:28.163 --> 11:32.033
I thought it'd be nice to patrol
the town with you sometimes,

11:32.033 --> 11:34.797
but I guess I wasn't needed.

11:36.438 --> 11:40.275
I suppose you're going
to keep looking around?

11:40.275 --> 11:42.766
Yes... Bye.

11:50.318 --> 11:53.378
It actually tried to possess
the one who defeated it.

11:58.660 --> 12:00.795
Were you aware of that?

12:00.795 --> 12:02.820
Touda knew it as well.

12:03.665 --> 12:08.703
I'm not surprised that
Masahiro didn't notice it.

12:08.703 --> 12:11.072
I wonder who summoned
the creature?

12:11.072 --> 12:13.375
We don't know what
its motive is.

12:13.375 --> 12:16.344
But whatever it is must
have a lot of power.

12:16.344 --> 12:18.005
Eliminate!

12:19.648 --> 12:22.183
Rikugou, I'm sorry,
but could you...

12:22.183 --> 12:24.981
stay with Masahiro
for a while longer?

12:28.924 --> 12:31.290
Byakko. Suzaku.

12:34.462 --> 12:35.897
What is it?

12:35.897 --> 12:39.301
Trouble's brewing somewhere
in the capital tonight.

12:39.301 --> 12:41.002
Seek it.

12:41.002 --> 12:43.538
I understand. Let's go.

12:43.538 --> 12:46.241
Keep the winds down,
will you?

12:46.241 --> 12:48.402
Come on, I'm not Taiin.

12:56.017 --> 12:59.418
I'll stay on my guard until
the source is found.

13:21.309 --> 13:23.445
Where is he?

13:23.445 --> 13:28.178
That man... Where is he...

13:28.483 --> 13:30.747
Where is he?

13:36.124 --> 13:39.252
- What is it?
- Hey, who's that?

13:42.597 --> 13:44.724
Where is he?!

13:48.169 --> 13:50.899
What's wrong?
What's the commotion...

13:52.173 --> 13:54.471
You're not the one.

13:58.847 --> 14:01.577
Where is he?

14:02.217 --> 14:04.117
Monster!

14:10.291 --> 14:13.395
A-Am I safe now?

14:13.395 --> 14:15.897
H-Hey... get me home now!

14:15.897 --> 14:18.066
Hey! Is anyone there?

14:18.066 --> 14:21.229
You people...
left me alone here!

14:30.378 --> 14:35.008
What?! An onryou attacked the
High Counselor of the Fujiwara?

14:35.850 --> 14:40.221
A guard found him lying
on the road last night.

14:40.221 --> 14:43.058
Cases of people being spirited
away were bad enough.

14:43.058 --> 14:45.160
An onryou has appeared now?

14:45.160 --> 14:47.762
That's what the minor demons
were talking about, right?

14:47.762 --> 14:49.491
I guess so.

14:52.834 --> 14:56.471
Hey, Toshitsugu is
a Fujiwara too, isn't he?

14:56.471 --> 15:00.642
That's right, but his family
isn't of a high rank.

15:00.642 --> 15:03.511
The man who encountered
the onryou last night...

15:03.511 --> 15:05.714
was also from
the Fujiwara family.

15:05.714 --> 15:07.375
So he might know something.

15:08.283 --> 15:10.485
What is it, Masahiro?

15:10.485 --> 15:14.556
Well... The high counselor who
encountered the onryou...

15:14.556 --> 15:17.659
Do you know which
family he belongs to?

15:17.659 --> 15:22.460
If I'm not wrong, I believe
he's Lord Chunagon's third son.

15:23.231 --> 15:25.633
Did Master Seimei
say anything?

15:25.633 --> 15:28.169
No, he didn't.

15:28.169 --> 15:30.238
Masahiro, your grandfather,

15:30.238 --> 15:33.108
father and brothers are
great onmyouji.

15:33.108 --> 15:36.244
And they have made
a name for themselves...

15:36.244 --> 15:38.880
But... you're just
an errand boy.

15:38.880 --> 15:41.583
You've not even
undergone training.

15:41.583 --> 15:46.020
You've also been ill for a long
time and neglected your work.

15:46.020 --> 15:49.090
If you intervene in
perilous situations,

15:49.090 --> 15:51.159
you might just get hurt.

15:51.159 --> 15:54.529
Don't you agree that it'd be
for the best if you realized...

15:54.529 --> 15:56.364
you can't ride on
the coattails...

15:56.364 --> 15:58.662
of your father and
grandfather forever?

16:00.368 --> 16:02.237
Those are harsh words,

16:02.237 --> 16:04.705
but that's how things
work in the real world.

16:08.143 --> 16:09.444
Masahiro...

16:09.444 --> 16:13.982
I'll show that guy how things
work in the real world.

16:13.982 --> 16:15.750
No, don't.

16:15.750 --> 16:17.819
Coattails, huh.

16:17.819 --> 16:20.922
It wasn't easy hearing
it said so bluntly.

16:20.922 --> 16:24.790
Of all the things I've heard,
what he said cut really deep.

16:36.871 --> 16:40.108
Why is he so depressed?
What's wrong?

16:40.108 --> 16:44.179
Don't worry, Princess.
Someone envies him.

16:44.179 --> 16:45.908
Envy?

16:46.247 --> 16:48.716
Well, he's an obedient
and hardworking boy.

16:48.716 --> 16:51.719
Plus, he has a lot of guts
thanks to Seimei.

16:51.719 --> 16:55.780
Important people are starting
to take notice of his talent.

16:57.258 --> 16:59.928
But others around his age
don't like that...

16:59.928 --> 17:02.863
because he makes
them look bad...

17:03.298 --> 17:06.835
He's worked really hard
until now, so it was okay...

17:06.835 --> 17:09.704
But he's been absent from
the onmyou dorms lately...

17:09.704 --> 17:11.172
as he was sick or busy...

17:11.172 --> 17:14.664
The resentment has become
more obvious due to that.

17:15.543 --> 17:19.514
Oh, it's got nothing to do
with you! Please don't worry.

17:19.514 --> 17:22.083
Seimei and Masahiro
would be angry...

17:22.083 --> 17:24.244
if they knew I had
upset you.

17:26.187 --> 17:30.556
Why don't you try to
cheer Masahiro up?

17:33.027 --> 17:35.860
Why are you telling
her that?

17:37.999 --> 17:39.694
Masahiro...

17:42.904 --> 17:47.034
I don't care about
what people say about me...

17:47.175 --> 17:49.644
It's true I've been
absent a lot...

17:49.644 --> 17:52.078
I'll just have to work
even harder.

17:53.615 --> 17:55.216
But then...

17:55.216 --> 17:58.753
It's tough to hear them talk
about my grandfather's coattail...

17:58.753 --> 18:01.122
Masahiro, aren't you
angry that...

18:01.122 --> 18:03.488
people tell such lies
about you?

18:03.825 --> 18:07.488
- Why should I get angry?
- But...

18:08.329 --> 18:09.831
If it were me...

18:09.831 --> 18:13.701
I'd get angry too if a new
errand runner was often absent.

18:13.701 --> 18:15.965
I understand how
they feel...

18:16.638 --> 18:19.040
And yet Lord Yukinari
and Lord Michinaga...

18:19.040 --> 18:21.099
they are really good to me.

18:23.578 --> 18:26.138
- Are you all right?
- Yes.

18:30.518 --> 18:32.611
It's nothing!

18:36.090 --> 18:38.393
All right! let's go
take a look at Ukyo...

18:38.393 --> 18:40.495
where the onryou was
sighted yesterday!

18:40.495 --> 18:43.998
- Stop acting tough.
- I'm not acting tough!

18:43.998 --> 18:45.761
Oh, really.

18:47.001 --> 18:50.801
Akiko's comforting words
are amazing...

18:53.074 --> 18:54.642
Come on, Mokkun.

18:54.642 --> 18:57.372
Hurry up! Move faster!

19:01.883 --> 19:04.352
Oh, what was that?

19:04.352 --> 19:08.523
I-I wonder!
Maybe it was a weasel.

19:08.523 --> 19:11.592
It might even be
a mononoke.

19:11.592 --> 19:13.958
I-It can't be!

19:14.862 --> 19:17.330
I'm a little worried.

19:18.833 --> 19:23.104
Excuse me, Lady Tsuyuki, what
should I do after this?

19:23.104 --> 19:26.874
Oh my, Miss Akiko.
Great job!

19:26.874 --> 19:29.377
You're very talented,
my dear.

19:29.377 --> 19:30.571
Thank you.

19:35.516 --> 19:37.652
The Fujiwara Counselor
was attacked...

19:37.652 --> 19:39.643
in the vicinity
last night, right?

19:43.891 --> 19:46.189
- Mokkun.
- Yes.

19:46.494 --> 19:48.462
Something's in there.

19:50.098 --> 19:52.867
Whose house was this?

19:52.867 --> 19:55.603
If I'm not wrong,
it's the house of a noble...

19:55.603 --> 19:58.573
who angered the Mikado long
ago and was demoted.

19:58.573 --> 20:01.440
His name was... well...

20:02.243 --> 20:06.114
Demoted? Was he exiled
somewhere far away?

20:06.114 --> 20:09.317
I think so. He was unable
to return to the capital,

20:09.317 --> 20:11.386
and died in that
distant land.

20:11.386 --> 20:15.482
Those who lose political battles
usually don't have good endings.

20:15.990 --> 20:18.959
Where is that man?!

20:23.564 --> 20:26.134
- Don't get drawn in.
- I know.

20:26.134 --> 20:29.831
Tell me, where is
that wretched man?!

20:30.571 --> 20:32.368
Who does he want?

20:32.640 --> 20:35.810
- You want the owner of this house?
- No.

20:35.810 --> 20:38.212
I am the master
of this house.

20:38.212 --> 20:41.149
Then who is it
that you want?

20:41.149 --> 20:44.778
I seek...
that loathsome man.

20:45.253 --> 20:47.655
I hate him! I hate him!

20:47.655 --> 20:51.250
I hate that man!

20:59.233 --> 21:01.002
He's gone...

21:01.002 --> 21:04.938
But... who exactly
is he looking for?

21:07.909 --> 21:10.611
I can't get anything
to align.

21:10.611 --> 21:15.275
Somebody or something out
there is tampering with destiny.

21:42.810 --> 21:54.255
Everyone, as time passes,
loses sight of his dreams

21:54.255 --> 22:05.600
Errors and pains are repeated
through the ages

22:05.600 --> 22:11.339
Why do we resist believing
in each other?

22:11.339 --> 22:16.971
Why do we put out
the light of fate?

22:19.213 --> 22:29.524
I want to protect our future
with this hand

22:29.524 --> 22:36.364
Because you taught me

22:36.364 --> 22:41.569
What it means to challenge
with all my strength

22:41.569 --> 22:47.341
You will keep overcoming
your limits

22:47.341 --> 22:54.474
Surely surely surely

22:59.620 --> 23:02.453
Next Episode

23:23.544 --> 23:25.012
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.012 --> 23:26.514
Episode 14.

23:26.514 --> 23:29.050
Episode 14
It is Like the Full Moon
to Wane
It is Like the Full Moon
to Wane.
